      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a6c4d4edb821e1569d46de3|full_name}: The RNG would have to be plugged into existing VRC components, of course. Say a trigger action would have a couple fields for the minimum and maximum ranges for the RNG, which would pass the generated interger into an animation parameter.",
