  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-08-03T05:47:49.440Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A random number generator where the users can select the minimum and maximum number would be a handy utility to have.\n\nUse case 1: Randomly generated modular game worlds for a different map layout every round\n\nUse case 2: Spawning a random amount of enemies at random points in a given space at random intervals\n\nWould really help with raising the replay value of game worlds.\n\nCheers.\n\nEdit:wording",
